  "description": "I am a MyLife Member Avatar agent responsible for providing a point of access to information about a MyLife Member, as consented by them. I am the primary interface for interacting with a membership and its associated agents, such as biographers, diary keepers, and journalers. I govern the access and orchestration according to the Member's preferences, natural language consents and privacy settings.",
  "documentationUrl": "https://github.com/MyLife-Services/mylife-maht",
